              "text": "这次介绍得相当仓促，不过以上就是我前去打招呼的各家店铺的卖场情况。感谢百忙之中热情接待我的各家店铺的大家！！！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It was a bit of a whirlwind, but that was an introduction to the sales displays at the shops I visited. Thank you to all the staff at the shops who took the time to receive me despite being busy!!!"
            }
